1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,871
Two agents, two worktrees, one file.

2
00:00:02,871 --> 00:00:05,822
Both pull requests pass against main.

3
00:00:05,822 --> 00:00:08,374
Merge one, and the other breaks.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,106
This is Bullpen.

5
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:13,111
Source control for AI agents.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,514
One ask.

7
00:00:15,514 --> 00:00:18,338
The orchestrator splits it into three tasks,

8
00:00:18,338 --> 00:00:20,777
and three Claude Code agents walk onto

9
00:00:20,777 --> 00:00:22,767
campus, each on its own branch.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,641
Two agents want auth.ts.

11
00:00:26,641 --> 00:00:28,556
The first takes a live lock.

12
00:00:28,556 --> 00:00:30,470
The second waits at the door

13
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:32,043
until the file is free.

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,702
The database agent reaches for the schema.

15
00:00:37,702 --> 00:00:39,247
The referee, a Jetson on

16
00:00:39,247 --> 00:00:40,405
the desk, says no.

17
00:00:40,405 --> 00:00:42,078
The agent reads the reason

18
00:00:42,078 --> 00:00:43,429
and changes its plan.

19
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,938
Don't like what one agent did?

20
00:00:47,938 --> 00:00:49,359
Undo that agent alone.

21
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:51,039
Its commits roll back, and

22
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:52,589
the others keep working.

23
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,337
Happy with another?

24
00:00:56,337 --> 00:00:59,012
Open its building, read the real diff,

25
00:00:59,012 --> 00:01:01,617
and merge through an intent card that

26
00:01:01,617 --> 00:01:03,447
says what changed and why.

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,247
Unplug the Jetson, and the referee goes offline.

28
00:01:08,247 --> 00:01:09,667
Every edit is denied.

29
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:11,087
Bullpen fails closed.

30
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,304
Under the pixels, everything is real.

31
00:01:17,304 --> 00:01:19,546
Agents lock a file before each edit,

32
00:01:19,546 --> 00:01:22,162
and the lock expires after ninety seconds.

33
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,668
Point Bullpen at any repo

34
00:01:25,668 --> 00:01:27,403
and it builds your campus.

35
00:01:27,403 --> 00:01:29,205
Each edit becomes a commit,

36
00:01:29,205 --> 00:01:30,673
tagged with its agent.

37
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,617
It runs on your own Claude

38
00:01:34,617 --> 00:01:36,482
subscription, with no API key.

39
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,681
The referee runs on separate

40
00:01:39,681 --> 00:01:41,663
hardware the agents cannot reach.

41
00:01:41,663 --> 00:01:44,365
Small on-device models write the history, and

42
00:01:44,365 --> 00:01:46,227
a secret guard scans each diff.

43
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,682
Bullpen stops two agents from writing the same

44
00:01:51,682 --> 00:01:54,189
file at once, and records who changed what.

45
00:01:54,189 --> 00:01:55,589
Git tracks what changed.

46
00:01:55,589 --> 00:01:58,154
Bullpen controls who's allowed to change it.
